    "reading_order": 8,
    "text": "Now, suppose two points lie on the x-axis.\nCan we find the distance between them? For\ninstance, consider two points A(4, 0) and B(6, 0)\nin Fig. 7.2. The points A and B lie on the x-axis.",
    "latex": null,
