      315.62,
      261.61,
      341.31
    ],
    "reading_order": 10,
    "text": "Therefore, the distance of B from A, i.e.,\nAB = OB – OA = 6 – 4 = 2 units.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
